iem|a|Disposed to give pain to others; willing or pleased to hurt, torment, or afflict; destitute of sympathetic kindness and pity; savage; inhuman; hard-hearted; merciless. ; Causing, or fitted to cause, pain, grief, or misery. ; Attended with cruetly; painful; harsh.	j:1mww,48,6~1mww,48,6
